[00:24.44]Only eat or write
[00:26.08]Or pull the trigger with your right hand
[00:28.42]Only thing that's left
[00:30.17]Is to work on following commands
[00:32.50]By the time you realize
[00:34.18]You'll be restrained to a desk
[00:36.23]And with your dreams on the floor you comply
