[01:11.23]Reflected upon the murky gutter sky
[01:15.03]Don't ask me why
[01:17.10]I desperately wish to be included in the city's night
[01:22.87]
[01:37.83]Pick up a knife and stab a familiar warm body
[01:41.62]Learned to fight before
[01:43.10]I knew love or bitterness of coffee
[01:45.60]Snippy scissors cut down the strings
[01:47.82]I set myself free
[01:49.61]Only to figure out everything I chose was by proxy
[01:53.89]As we suckled upon the nine millameter pacifier
[01:57.86]Swallowing the fact that other than to expand
[02:00.51]We had no purpose
[02:01.97]As my ever-burning will to stay afloat backfires
[02:05.95]I now know I must be comfortable being
[02:08.07]Who I considered worthless
[02:10.36]Follow the city's ribbon
[02:14.03]To a heart nobody seems to listen
[02:18.67]It takes my heart being broken and broken again
[02:21.95]
[02:22.62]To know that I am the reason why
[02:24.64]The sufferings never end
[02:26.64]Now it's time for another vendetta hmm mmm mmm
